    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the clockwork workshop of the eccentric inventor, Lord Blackwood. The air is thick with the scent of oil and ozone, and the rhythmic ticking of gears echoes off the soot-stained walls. The heavy iron door has been sealed shut. To escape, you must decipher the inventor's final masterpiece. Scattered around the room are strange brass contraptions and steam-powered devices. You must piece together the correct sequence of mechanical operations to prove your worth and unlock the final gateway before the workshop's boiler reaches critical pressure.",
